        "TileImage": "$($repository 7af86858-df9d-478b-b5d8-803379cd165f).Image",
        "Description": "Whittleton Creek. Orderly. Predictable. Complacent.\n\nOne target has been identified.\nLocals call him the “BBQ King.” A man of pride, routine, and appetite.\n\nToday, that routine ends.\n\nNo disruption. No spectacle.\nThe environment will do the work.\n\nIntroduce a subtle change. Let consumption become consequence.\nBy the time suspicion forms, it will already be too late.\n\nMaintain a clean profile. Suit required.\nNo trace. No witnesses.\n\nLet the king feast—\nand reduce him to ash.",
